# Local game save data. The app writes these to the OS data dir (directories
# crate `ProjectDirs`), never the repo — so normal playtesting can't commit
# them. Ignored here (root-anchored) only as a safety net for a save copied into
# the repo while debugging. `/settings.json` is anchored so it never matches the
# tracked `.claude/settings.json`.
/profile.json
/settings.json
/saves/
